<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dell raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dell raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Dell Computer Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Late yesterday, Dell reported fourth quarter net income of $1.01 per share, up from $0.35 a year ago and well above the $0.83 per share First Call consensus forecast.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-1/2 to 74-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
